\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Differences on a cycle of sites}
\date{2026-11-03}


\p{Label the sites of a cycle by #{\mathbb Z/n\mathbb Z}. The value of
a field at the next site is again a value at a site, and subtracting
the value at a site from the value at the next site is the derivative
one writes when the step has length #{1}. The next definition records
these two operations, and the claim after it is their product rule.}
